-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("es",393,{
[12545]="7006AFD2\n1\tDefeat Deshûkh smugglers (total: 8)\tYou should investigate Deshûkh for signs of Amârbo. Deshûkh is located north-west of the Dûlkar.\n2\tSearch for Amârbo in Deshûkh\tSearch for Amârbo in Deshûkh, the Blood Market.\n3\tAsk Amârbo what he knows of Sêkhta and his whereabouts\tAsk Amârbo what he knows of Sêkhta and his whereabouts.\n4\tReturn to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja with this information\tReturn to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja, Hall of the Kindred, with this information.\n",
[12546]="7006AFDF\n1\tFind Dar Sêkhta in Dil-irmíz\tKhôltekh has asked you to look for Dar Sêkhta, and a suspicious lock there that might fit a mysterious key. According to Amârbo, it is located south of Deshûkh in Dil-irmíz.\n2\tLook for a door within Dar Sêkhta with a suspicious lock\tLook for an alcove or door with an unconventional lock.\n3\tExamine the strange lock for clues as to its key\tExamine the strange lock for clues as to its key.\n4\tReturn to Dâr Laja and tell Khôltekh your description of the lock\tReturn to Dâr Laja with your description of the lock. Perhaps Khôltekh has a clue as to its key.\n5\tSpeak with Khôltekh when you are ready to go\tAccompany Khôltekh to his house, so he may think clearly on this key.\n",
[12547]="7006B07C\n1\tFind a pristine crypt-walker's hand by defeating crypt-walkers\tKhôltekh has asked you to go to Sektakhâb in Khabârkhad and find a pristine wight's hand. He believes this is the key to Dâr Sêkhta that will open the way and find Sêkhta or necessary clues about him.\n2\tFind a pristine crypt-walker's hand by defeating crypt-walkers\tKhôltekh has asked you to go to Sektakhâb in Khabârkhad and find a pristine wight's hand. He believes this is the key to Dâr Sêkhta that will open the way and find Sêkhta or necessary clues about him.\n3\tGo back to Dâr Sêkhta and insert the pristine wight's hand into the lock\tGo back to Dâr Sêkhta and insert the pristine wight's hand into the lock.\n4\tEnter the hidden area of Dâr Sêkhta\tEnter the hidden area of Dâr Sêkhta.\n5\tReturn to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja with the clues you have found\tReturn to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja with the clues you have found.\n",
[12548]="7006B07B\n1\tSpeak with Ephrâti in Tilmakhím in Tâkhdar\tFind a bookseller named Ephrâti in Tilmakhím, in Tâkhdar. Khôltekh is looking for the missing volume from the set you found in Dâr Sêkhta.\n2\tReturn to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja with the book\tReturn to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja with the book.\n3\tSpeak with Khôltekh when you are ready to go\tAccompany Khôltekh to the Tor-gardens.\n4\tSpeak with Khôltekh about his revelation\tSpeak with Khôltekh outside the Pot and Quill in the Tor-gardens about his revelation.\n",
[12549]="7006B07D\n1\tSpeak with Khôltekh when you are ready to go\tSpeak with Khôltekh to go to the Sail-haven.\n2\tSpeak with Khôltekh in Dâr Laja\tSpeak with Khôltekh in Dâr Laja.\n",
[12550]="70001731\n1\tHabla con Garvan\tGarvan está en la ciudad de Donnvail, al noreste de Fail-Á-Khro. Búdan te habló de los tres líderes enviados a Donnvail por Carn Dûm: Fûshath la Bestia, Muiráthakh la Jueza Silenciosa y Gillë Andras el Señor de las Fronteras del Oeste. También te dijo que hablaras con un hombre llamado Garvan más adentro en la ciudad de Donnvail.\n2\tHabla con Morven\tMorven está dentro de la ciudad de Donnvail, al noreste de Fail-Á-Khro. Garvan te dio el nombre de alguien que podría simpatizar con la causa, diciéndote que buscaras a Morven más adentro en la ciudad.\n3\tHabla con Uthagan\tUthagan está en la ciudad de Donnvail, al noreste de Fail-Á-Khro. Morven te ha dicho que hables con Uthagan, pero con precaución: su familia fue tomada recientemente por Muiráthakh, y ella no cree que hayan sido vistos desde entonces.\n4\tHabla con Una\tUthagan habló de Una, que se encuentra en algún lugar de la ciudad de Donnvail, al noreste de Fail-Á-Khro. Aunque intentó matarte, Uthagan te dio sin querer el nombre de alguien con quien podrías hablar: una mujer llamada Una.\n",
[12551]="7002C609\n1\tHabla con el Capitán Agelbrit\tHabla con el Capitán Agelbrit en el puesto de guardia de la Garganta del Limclaro.\n2\tHabla con Sigelm\tSigelm está cerca del puesto de guardia de la Garganta del Limclaro. El Capitán Agelbrit te ha pedido que escuches los relatos de Sigelm sobre la Garganta del Limclaro antes de explorar el peligroso valle.\n3\tHabla con el Capitán Agelbrit\t\n",
[12552]="7002C5F5\n1\tHabla con Armund en la vieja serrería\tDeberías encontrar la vieja serrería de la Garganta del Limclaro y averiguar si Armund y sus compañeros siguen vivos.\n",
[12553]="700682D8\n1\tTalk to Adranax at the agreed upon location\tJavish has asked you to initiate negotiations between a renegade Corsair group which poses a threat to the status quo in Mâr Naphra. The meeting location should be among the shallows to the south-east.\n2\tTalk to Javish\tAdranax planned to betray Javish all along. Javish should know that you had no choice but to defend yourself. Javish can be found in Mâr Naphra.\n3\tDefeat Corsairs in Khataj Mârsa (total: 8)\tJavish has no choice but to take Adranax's actions as an act of sedition. He asks that we punish the Corsairs before they can cause further chaos. Khataj Mârsa can be found south-east of Mâr Naphra.\n4\tTalk to Javish in Mâr Naphra\tThe Corsairs at Khataj Mârsa have been punished. You should report to Javish your success. Javish can be found in Mâr Naphra.\n",
[12554]="70067537\n1\tReturn the bandanas to Tagar in Jax Phanâl\030Collect goblin bandanas from Súlstrok or environs ([según el diario]/12)\tTagar asked that you return to the goblins' encampment south and east of Jax Phanâl in a further attempt to remove the goblin threat from the area. You are to collect twelve of the goblins' bandanas, and return them to Tagar at his dwelling.\n",
[12555]="7002BFF8\n1\tDerrota a Sherkóz\tEl entrenador de los gatos de batalla Khundolar debe encontrarse en Lashkarg, al sureste de Etheburg, en las Tierras Pardas. Twiga te ha pedido que des caza al entrenador de los gatos de batalla Khundolar y le derrotes.\n2\tHabla con Twiga en Etheburg, en las Tierras Pardas\tTwiga está en Etheburg, en las Tierras Pardas, al noroeste de Lashkarg. Deberías volver a ver a Twiga con la noticia de tu victoria.\n",
[12556]="70067F93\n1\tGather insects (total: 5)\tRaghda-gûn asked you to gather insects to feed to her little adoptee. Insects can be found underneath little stones scattered around the Raghda-gûn's nest.\n2\tTalk to Raghda-gûn\tYou have gathered enough insects to feed little Berkha. Return to Raghda-gûn.\n",
[12557]="700529E3\n1\tFind the Elf at the Beorning watchpost\tAn Elf was sent to the Beorning Watchpost in Gladden Fields by the Woodfolk in Laerlad. You should see if this Elf made it to the watchpost.\n2\tTalk to Baradal\tYou have found the Elf at the Beorning watchpost on the edge of the Gladden Fields. You should talk to the Elf.\n",
[12558]="7003A662\n1\tRecoge piedras para hacer lanzamientos (total: 4)\tLas cataratas de Everholt se encuentran al suroeste de Atalaya de la Almenara. La dama Answith quiere ir a las cataratas de Everholt y recoger varias piedras que serían adecuadas para hacer lanzamientos.\n2\tHabla con la dama Answith\tLa dama Answith se encuentra en un porche sobre la zona de los comerciantes, al norte del Salón del Hidromiel en Atalaya de la Almenara. Has recogido piedras para hacer lanzamientos en las cataratas de Everholt y ahora deberías llevárselas a la dama Answith.\n",
[12559]="700309E7\n1\tLleva los barriles de pólvora al pozo central de las Profundidades vivientes (cantidad: según el diario)\tSe pueden encontrar barriles de pólvora en las Profundidades vivientes. Dernstan te pidió que te adentraras en las Profundidades vivientes y destruyeras de manera segura la pólvora negra del enemigo.\n2\tHabla con Dernstan\tDernstan está en Eaworth. Dernstan se alegrará de saber que has destruido de manera segura varios barriles de pólvora negra.\n",
[12560]="7002F308\n1\tDerrota a los trasgos en las Profundidades vivientes (total: 10)\tLos trasgos se encuentran en las Profundidades vivientes.\n2\tHabla con Dernstan\tDernstan se encuentra en Eaworth. Dernstan estará complacido de saber que derrotaste a varios trasgos en las Profundidades vivientes.\n",
[12561]="700164E1\n1\tDerrota a los sapos profundos (total: 8)\tLos sapos profundos se pueden encontrar por todas las Obras Hidráulicas. Águti cree que cuando los sapos sean eliminados los lagartos y las arañas se comerán entre sí.\n2\tHabla con Águti en la Bodega Putrefacta\tÁguti se encuentra en la Bodega Putrefacta. Águti estará contento de escuchar que la población de sapos profundos ha sido reducida.\n",
[12562]="700078EB\n1\tHabla con Mason Espino en el campamento de leñadores de Combe\tMason Espino está en el campamento de leñadores, al norte y este de la casa de guardia. Ted Abrojos te pidió que hablaras con Mason Espino, el capataz del campamento de leñadores de Combe. Puede que recuerde qué árbol era el Árbol de la Horca.\n2\tLleva el libro de cuentas a Mason Espino\030Recoge el libro de cuentas de Mason Espino\tMason Espino te espera en el campamento de leñadores que está al este y norte de Combe, al sur del bosque de Chet. Espino te envió a recuperar su libro de cuentas de los bandidos Montebruno acampados junto al camino. Debes devolverle el libro de inmediato.\n",
[12563]="7004327D\n1\tSearch the Crossings of Erui for sign of the Lone Lady\tThe Crossings of Erui can be found far to the north of Halach in eastern Upper Lebennin. Glassiel has asked you to search the Crossings of Erui for any sign of the mysterious Lone Lady.\n2\tDisturb the nearby pile of river-stones\tRiver-stones can be found at the Crossings of Erui in eastern Upper Lebennin. You have found only a drowned Haradrim and should now search for the Lone Lady of Erui.\n3\tAttempt to talk to the Lone Lady\tThe Lone Lady can be found at the Crossings of Erui in eastern Upper Lebennin. After disturbing a pile of river-stones, the Lone Lady has appeared in a rage. You should attempt to speak to her.\n4\tTalk to Glassiel\tGlassiel can be found in Halach in south-eastern Upper Lebennin. The Lone Lady has given her waters form using pieces of ancient armour and has banished you from the Erui. You should bring these dire tidings to Glassiel.\n",
[12564]="70065656\n1\tTalk to Handir\tYou have found a lonely dog in East Pelargir. A nearby guard, Handir, has called out to you.\n2\tTalk to Handir\tYou have found a lonely dog in East Pelargir. A nearby guard, Handir, has called out to you.\n3\tFeed the lonely dog\tHandir has given you some meat with which to feed the lonely dog.\n4\tTalk to Handir\tYou have fed the lonely dog. You should talk to Handir.\n",
[12565]="7004A397\n1\tSearch the northward road\tYou should follow the road that winds north from western Udûn.\n2\tSigue por el camino\tYou should continue up the road that winds north from western Udûn.\n3\tRaise the Gondorian banner\tYou should raise the fallen Gondorian banner that you found on the road that winds north from western Udûn.\n4\tYou should continue up the road that winds north from western Udûn, righting any other banners that you find.\t\n5\tContinue up the road, fixing any other fallen banners you find\tYou should continue up the road that winds north from western Udûn.\n6\tTalk to the look-out\tYou should talk to the look-out on the outcropping off the road that winds north from western Udûn, and learn what he knows of Captain Lachír.\n7\tLook next to Coldan\tThe soldier Coldan has asked you to stand beside him and look up toward the looming face of Ered Lithui.\n8\tTalk to Coldan\tColdan the look-out stands on the outcropping off the road that winds north from western Udûn. You should talk to Coldan again, now that you looked and have seen the great edifice against the mountains.\n",
[12566]="70060D88\n1\tRecupera los suministros de la Guardia de Allende del agujero-almacén secreto\tLos suministros de la Guardia de Allende se encuentran en el agujero-almacén secreto en el bosque entre Gamwich y Quiebra Larga. Debes llevar los suministros de la Guardia de Allende a un Frontero en Quiebra Larga. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n2\tHabla con el Frontero Tugo en Quiebra Larga\tUn Frontero de la Guardia de Allende se encuentra en Quiebra Larga. Debes hablar con el Frontero Tugo en Quiebra Larga.\n3\tEnfréntate a Bill Helechal\tBill Helechal se encuentra cerca de Quiebra Larga en la Comarca Allende. Debes enfrentarte a Bill Helechal.\n4\tHabla con Fredegar Bolger en el agujero-almacén secreto\tHay un agujero-almacén secreto de la Guardia de Allende en el bosque entre Gamwich y Quiebra Larga. Debes hablar con Fredegar Bolger en el agujero-almacén.\n",
[12567]="70058CFA\n1\tDestroy Orkish trebuchets at Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh (total: 6)\030Destroy Orkish ballistae at Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh (total: 4)\tOrkish trebuchets and ballistae can be found in Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh. Darfin has asked you to destroy the siege-engines deployed in Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh. You should destroy Orkish trebuchets and ballistae.\n2\tCompletado\tYou have destroyed many Orkish trebuchets and ballistae at Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh.\n",
[12568]="7003A695\n1\tCross the bridge to leave Gapholt\tThe time has come to leave Gapholt and return to Woodhurst. You will need to pass over the bridge to begin your return journey.\n2\tWestan calls for your attention\tWestan is on the bridge leading into Gapholt. Westan saw you coming and called for your attention.\n3\tTravel to Mate Isernore\tMate Isernore is along the road between Gapholt and Woodhurst. Mate Isernore was once a mine owned by Gifemund, but was taken by the White Hand who crossed the Swiftwater River.\n4\tMate Isernore is along the road between Gapholt and Woodhurst. White Hand scourge should be wiped out of Mate Isernore and out of the northern Stonedeans. The mine and its resources were not theirs to take.\t\n5\tHabla con Herubrand\tHerubrand is in the cellar of the farmhouse in Woodhurst. You should return to Herubrand to inform him of your success in bringing aid from Gapholt and defeating the White Hand forces in Mate Isernore.\n",
[12569]="70053F48\n1\tStoke the fires (total: 6)\tFire pits can be found at Adambel. You should stoke the fires.\n2\tSoldiers can be found at Adambel. You should talk with the soldiers to pass the time.\t\n3\tTalk to Habhûk\tHabhûk can be found at Adambel. You should talk to Habhûk.\n",
[12570]="7000E4DF\n1\tDerrota a los kalpa-kita (total: 12)\030Derrota a Pitkä-hammas\tLos kalpa-kita pueden encontrarse en Leijona-kotin, al este de Jänis-leiri. Niko quiere que reduzcas el número de kalpa-kita de la zona y que, en especial, derrotes a un felino feroz llamado Pitkä-hammas.\n2\tHabla con Niko\tNiko se encuentra en Jänis-leiri, al oeste de Leijona-kotin. Deberías regresar con Niko y comunicarle tu éxito.\n",
[12571]="7006AA08\n1\tTalk to Porókho\tPorókho would like to speak with you privately. Porókho is in Hêbatokh, the clan Morutágya camp in Ilmabiri, beneath the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.\n2\tTalk to Belondor in Dâr Laja\tAfter helping the grateful Morutágya clan with their requests, you feel that you have been dismissed. You should return to Belondor in Dâr Laja, the Meeting Hall and tell him what you learned.\n",
[12572]="7005A801\n1\tTalk to Dáin\tDáin can be found at Durin's Stone. After overcoming Azog's forces at Durin's Stone, Náin Orcsfoe and the Iron-folk prepare to again make for the gates of Moria. You should talk to Dáin.\n2\tTalk to Dáin at Muru Azog\tDáin can be found just outside Muru Azog at Azanulbizar. Azog has been slain at last, but victory was won at great cost. You should talk to Dáin.\n3\tTalk to King Thráin at Muru Azog\tKing Thráin can be found just outside Muru Azog at Azanulbizar. Azog has been slain at last, but Dáin has fallen silent. You should talk to King Thráin.\n",
[12573]="700436CF\n1\tDefeat Easterlings in the Brotherhood of the Pinioned (total: 5)\tFollowers of the Brotherhood of the Pinioned can be found throughout Osgiliath, and often wander far from their Easterling brethren. You recall Echil's mentioning of a \"Lord of Pinions\" among the Easterlings who now form a brotherhood under him. You should seek out and defeat his followers to learn more of his whereabouts. NOTE: You must defeat all five groups of Easterling followers to unlock the optional Lord of Pinions encounter.\n2\tDefeat the Lord of Pinions\tThe Lord of Pinions can be found in the north-eastern corner of Osgiliath. You have weakened the Brotherhood of the Pinioned, and should now confront the Lord of Pinions in Osgiliath.\n",
[12574]="70015E0F\n1\tEl uruk Gâmzhurm se encuentra al sur y ligeramente al oeste de Echad Dúnann, al otro lado del Nan Sirannon. Debes usar el cuerno de desafío para invocar a Gâmzhurm, el líder de los dunlendinos, y derrotarle.\t\n2\tHabla con Glavroleth en Echad Dúnnan\tGlavroleth está en Echad Dúnann, al norte y ligeramente al este de Porth Cadlus. Deberías volver a ver a Glavroleth con las noticias de la muerte de Gâmzhurm.\n",
[12575]="700083A6\n1\tDerrota a Gillë Andras\tGillë Andras, el Señor de las Marcas Occidentales, se encuentra en la ciudad de Dún Covád, en las colinas occidentales al norte de Fail-á-Khro. Soltakh te ha pedido a ti y a tus aliados que derrotes a Gillë Andras, el Señor de las Marcas Occidentales.\n2\tHabla con Soltakh\tSoltakh está en Fail-á-Khro, al norte de Aughaire y al sur de Dún Covád. Has derrotado a Gillë Andras, el Señor de las Marcas Occidentales, y ahora deberías llevar la noticia de tu triunfo a Soltakh.\n",
[12576]="70066612\n1\tTalk to Malthellam in Morlad\tMalthellam can be found outside his home in Morlad in the Blackroot Vale. You have been told to travel to Morlad to seek an audience with the Steward of the Vale, Malthellam, and gain the Lord's permission to remain in the Blackroot Vale.\n",
})
